				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "# CVSS Calculator\n\n{{gtClass:Gt4SecurityCvssVector}} parses CVSS vector strings (V2, V3.0, V3.1, V4.0) and computes base scores using the official FIRST.org formulas. The result is an inspectable domain object — the **Summary** tab shows version, score, and severity label; the **Metrics** tab shows each metric broken down with its full name and value.\n\n- **V2**: formula-based (Impact × Exploitability), standard rounding\n- **V3.0 / V3.1**: formula-based (ISS → Impact → Exploitability), Roundup (ceiling to 0.1) — identical formulas, different prefix\n- **V4.0**: MacroVector lookup table (312 entries) + interpolation, standard rounding\n\nPaste any CVSS vector string into the snippets below to compute its score."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
