					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## CVSS v2\n\nV2 vectors have no prefix — just `AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:C`. Severity labels: Low (0-3.9), Medium (4.0-6.9), High (7.0-10.0)."
			},
