				},
				"string" : "## CVSS v3.1\n\nPrefix `CVSS:3.1/`. Scope (S:U/S:C) changes both the impact formula and the PR weight. Severity: None (0.0), Low (0.1-3.9), Medium (4.0-6.9), High (7.0-8.9), Critical (9.0-10.0)."
