				},
				"string" : "## Diff views\n\n{{gtClass:Gt4SecurityCvssComparison}} lets you compare 2 or more CVSS vectors side by side. Three views:\n- **Score comparison** — score, severity, delta from highest, visual bar\n- **Metric diff** — every metric across all vectors, `!=` flag where values differ\n- **Differences only** — filtered to just the metrics that diverge\n\nClick any row in Score comparison to drill into that vector's full metric breakdown."
